    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i think they'll find those cases really impactful. to round out the lesson, i'd also like to touch on the different legal schools of thought regarding this. can you explain why some legal scholars and judges argue that this doctrine is a necessary protection for civil rights, while acknowledging the view that it's a problematic way to interpret the Constitution?",
